cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "safe-agent-l: A Runtime Enforcement Library for Governed Autonomous AI Agent Systems"
type: software
abstract: >-
  safe-agent-l is a Python runtime enforcement library for autonomous AI agent
  systems. It applies four independent controls at the point of action:
  constraint enforcement, auditable decision traces, defense-in-depth safety
  controls, and fail-closed resilience.
